  m_text: "<color=#9BE89B>public static GameManager\n    Instance { get; private set; }</color>\n\n<color=#9BE89B>void Awake()\n{\n  if (Instance != null &&\n      Instance != this)\n  {\n    Destroy(gameObject);\n    return;\n  }\n  Instance = this;\n  DontDestroyOnLoad(gameObject);\n}</color>\n\n\u2022 \uC5B4\uB514\uC11C\uB098\n  GameManager.Instance.AddScore(10)\n\u2022 \uB0A8\uC6A9\uD558\uBA74 \uC758\uC874\uC774 \uC5BD\uD788\uB2C8\n  '\uC815\uB9D0 \uD558\uB098\uBFD0\uC778 \uAD00\uB9AC\uC790'\uC5D0\uB9CC"
